# Copied from the packages by `sync:theme`, which every android script runs
# before it builds. Tracking them bought nothing and cost six weeks of silent
# drift: the committed copy was last written 2026-06-27 while the source kept
# moving, so the storybook on device rendered against a stale theme and no
# check anywhere compared the two. A file that is regenerated on every build
# cannot drift if it is not in git.
app/adwaita.css
app/storybook.css
